      "frontend_label_en": "Read cluster mode",
      "note": "Production: batterylifepo4.yaml template text_sensor id read_cluster_mode (entity_category diagnostic). 'clusters' while every cluster is read as one Modbus request (docs/project/RS485_CLUSTERED_READ_MIGRATION_PLAN.md, M5); 'fallback:<cluster ids>' (e.g. 'fallback:A1,A2') once a lead cluster failed 3 consecutive reads and its group latched into the bounded legacy per-block readers. The latch holds until reboot, so the value never oscillates; it is published only on change from the 100 ms snapshot interval. Rendered read-only in the web UI's Diagnostics software list so a latched fallback is visible; never a Settings parameter or writable."
